Executive Summary

This report presents the results of a web application security audit conducted by Defensify on a publicly accessible test application.
The purpose of this assessment was to evaluate the application’s security posture, identify exploitable vulnerabilities, and assess their potential technical and business impact.

The audit combined automated vulnerability scanning with manual penetration testing to ensure accuracy and reduce false positives.
All findings included in this report were manually validated and prioritized based on real-world risk.

Overall Security Posture

The assessment identified critical and medium-risk vulnerabilities that could be exploited by attackers to compromise application data and user security.
If present in a production environment, these issues could lead to data breaches, user account compromise, and reputational damage.

Immediate remediation of critical findings is strongly recommended.

